# (explicit CRLF/LF/CR physical terminators, deliberately non-UTF-8 bytes).
# Marking them binary/-text prevents any newline or encoding normalization
# on add/checkout across machines with different core.autocrlf settings, so
# the committed bytes always match what the parser contract expects
# (Plan 02-08, D-02/D-03).
tests/fixtures/landing/**/*.csv -text -diff

